El hole di betemla attribute link (zay `href` aw `src`), fa qeemetha lazem teb2a `Url`, mesh `nass`. El string momken yeb2a link `javascript:`.

3│     khali page = html"""<a href="{home}">home</a>"""
                                     ^^^^

Mosa3da: Ebny el link b literal `url"..."`, aw 7allel el nass b `Url.parse(s)` elly bterfod `javascript:` w `data:` w `vbscript:`.

